  "title": "Every migration is an edge case nightmare. Can AI break the deadlock?",
  "summary": "Migrations are hard, but edge cases make them impossible. Every team we spoke to at Gartner had the same struggle: migrations stall because traditional automation can’t handle the weird, unpredictable mess of legacy systems. AI changes the game by understanding context, learning from feedback, and adapting to complexity in ways static tools never could.",
